  "details": "**Please add a help page for new users on how to stay safe.**\nNew users should know how to:\n- Block and mute\n- Submit moderation reports\n- Enable safety mode\n- Change their default safety settings\n- What types of malicious behaviour to look out for\nI don't think new players have an easy way to learn thse tools (outside loading screen tips). It would be great if we could refer new plages to a page on VRChat.com to help them stay safe.\nFor example, Habbo Hotel has a page explaining what tools users have to stay safe: https://help.habbo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360011511820-What-tools-does-Habbo-use-to-ensure-my-child-s-safety-",
